    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1195">

                <pb facs="0966" n="850" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg850"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.11/6977.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of the Navy to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Navy Department</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-11-26">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">November 26, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to acknowledge the
                    receipt of your letter of the 23d instant, in which you request that a vessel be
                    equipped with an expeditionary force and sent to Topolobampo, Mexico, for the
                    purpose of affording protection for the American colony at Los Mochis.</p>
                <p>On the 24th instant the Commander-in-chief of the Pacific Fleet was directed to
                    embark at San Francisco a force of about 275 marines and to sail with the least
                    possible delay for Topolobampo. <pb facs="0967" n="851" xml:id="pg851"/> The <hi
                        rendition="#italic">San Diego</hi> left San Francisco on the evening of the
                    25th instant, will stop at San Diego for an additional force, and should arrive
                    at Topolobampo about December second.</p>
                <p>Very sincerely yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Josephus Daniels.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
